        },
        "quote": "(a) No local historic landmark, contributing feature, or portion of either shall be demolished unless a certificate of appropriateness is approved by the City Council. Additionally, no permit to demolish a local historic landmark, contributing feature, or portion of either shall be issued prior to approval of a certificate of appropriateness.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.120 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "a303bbf8-ce69-53e8-8d10-3dc4352d84e1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 605,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:1",
          "start": 345
        },
        "quote": "(b) Citizen Participation. The applicant shall comply with the citizen participation process adopted by the Planning Director and posted on the City’s website. The Planning Director shall provide a map of the notification area which shall be a 500-foot radius.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.120 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "20b5b2ef-0e8a-5714-b919-1da7569f4337",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1025,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:2",
          "start": 606
        },
        "quote": "(c) Notification. The Topeka Landmarks Commission shall consider each application at a meeting; provided, that notice shall be mailed at least 20 days prior to the meeting to the owner(s) of record of the local historic landmark that is the subject of the application and the owners of record of properties located within any local historic district where the local historic landmark or contributing feature is located.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.120 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "627efb88-3216-5700-8e6d-734eb91aef6a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1298,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:3",
          "start": 1026
        },
        "quote": "(d) Meeting – Landmarks Commission. All interested persons may provide written comments and/or appear in person or by representative. The Commission shall make its determination based upon the Secretary of the Interior’s Standards for the Treatment of Historic Properties.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.120 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "4b56c540-857f-5f18-8bb5-1ef31dc49168",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1474,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:4",
          "start": 1299
        },
        "quote": "(e) After review and recommendation by the Topeka Landmarks Commission, the City Council may approve or deny the certificate of appropriateness based on the following factors:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.120 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "6f23125e-9128-5c1e-94d2-4d8b2ef02a18",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1566,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:5",
          "start": 1475
        },
        "quote": "(1) Whether feasible alternatives to demolition exist, including mothballing the structure;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.120 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "1b25b186-64ee-56e7-8499-5856498b5173",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1608,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:6",
          "start": 1567
        },
        "quote": "(2) The state of repair of the structure;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.120 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "c096e33e-4c85-5814-9f93-d4905ca218d0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1647,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:7",
          "start": 1609
        },
        "quote": "(3) The cost of restoration or repair;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.120 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "3bc2fd53-faf3-55c4-ba7e-9dd2a551db8c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1707,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:8",
          "start": 1648
        },
        "quote": "(4) Hardship to the applicant if the certificate is denied;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.120 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "9a793d4d-80a2-55c8-b141-04698178101c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1766,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:9",
          "start": 1708
        },
        "quote": "(5) Economic consequences to affected property owners; and",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.120 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "da118ca5-e8a2-588e-8d5a-e3dfe7e8c48c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1816,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:10",
          "start": 1767
        },
        "quote": "(6) The interest in preserving historical values.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.120 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "36b3101e-7b92-5913-8cea-916ad3158684",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2189,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:11",
          "start": 1817
        },
        "quote": "(f) Notwithstanding subsection (e) of this section, if the Topeka Landmarks Commission determines that the demolition will destroy historic property included in the National Register of Historic Places or the State Register of Historic Places, demolition shall not proceed until the Governing Body makes any determination required by K.S.A. 75-2724 and amendments thereto.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.255.120 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "f35b642d-923c-5513-a29e-16f5708ef673",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2448,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:12",
          "start": 2190
        },
        "quote": "(g) If a demolition is approved by the Council, the Planning Commission shall make a recommendation to the Governing Body whether to remove historic overlay zoning in accordance with State law and the ordinances governing rezoning. (Ord. 19901 § 13, 5-6-14.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.255.120:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
